<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS denies big stake in DePfa.</title>
<headline>UBS denies big stake in DePfa.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland (UBS) said a renewed check of its global holdings found it had a stake of less than one percent in German mortgage bank DePfa-Bank AG.</p>
<p>A UBS spokesman said his group had no intention of taking over DePfa despite market rumours started after DePfa said it had indications the Swiss group held about nine percent of its equity.</p>
</text>
